    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d251">

                <pb facs="0346" n="234" sameAs="frus:frus1919Russia/pg234"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861.00/6003: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The President of the Technical Board</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Stevens</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary
                        of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Harbin</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1919-12-27T18:00:00+08:26"><hi rendition="#italic">December 27,
                                1919, 6 p.m.</hi></date><lb/>[Received 6:05
                    p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>Reliable information through our inspectors Kolchak government completely
                    overthrown. Irkutsk and several smaller cities west of there in the possession
                    of Social Revolutionists. Czech commander-in-chief replying Semenoff very
                    defiant straightforward [<hi rendition="#italic">sic</hi>] and it <pb
                        facs="0347" n="235" xml:id="pg235"/> is reliably reported that fighting has
                    taken place. Americans apparently in no danger in disturbed districts as the
                    Czechs will provide protection. Telegraphic communication is interrupted Chita
                    and Irkutsk but the Czechs will not permit Semenoff to stop operation railway.
                    Disregard criticism of Czechs, they are fully justified in their acts. The
                    situation in and around Vladivostok is serious. Russian soldiers on the coal
                    branch guarded by Americans revolted. I expect political overthrow at
                    Vladivostok.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Stevens</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
